        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSF444, Cement Floor Mount Door Bumper with Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty floor mounted door stop features a holder / hook to secure the door against the rubber bumper and hold the door in an open position when desired. Packaged with heavy duty mounting anchor for cement floor installation. This door bumper is mounted to a cement floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it, protecting not just the door, but the door lever and the wall as well. Great for applications from high-end residences to large commercial projects. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSF444U-specifications.gif?v=1704354561\" width=\"580\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSF444  Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Without hold open hook <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-floor-mount-door-bumper-deltana-dsf3225\"><b>Deltana DSF3225 3\" Door Stop</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-floor-mount-bumper-with-hook-deltana-sahf358\"><b>Deltana SAHF358  Floor Mount Door Stop with Hook</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tip</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DSF444 Cement Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Rubber Bumper Top: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Rubber Bumper</b></a>: 1\" Diameter, Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSF444.pdf?v=1704262154\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  DSF444 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Cement Floor Mount Door Bumper with Holder, Deltana DSF444",
                "description": "Cement Floor Mount Door Bumper with Hook, Deltana DSF444 - This heavy duty floor mounted door stop features a holder / hook to secure the door against the rubber bumper and hold the door in an open position when desired. Packaged with heavy duty mounting anchor for cement floor installation. This door bumper is mounted to a cement floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it, protecting not just the door, but the door lever and the wall as well. Great for applications from high-end residences to large commercial projects. Available in 9 great finishes. ",
